@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
User -> System : submitInvalidCredentials(email, password)
activate System

note right of System: The system checks inputs against RestDB,\ndetects unmatched credentials, and raises an exception.

System --> User : displays user-friendly error message ("Invalid credentials...")
deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
